<title>SINGAPORE: Cabltetron targets US$200 mln Asia revenue.</title>
<headline>Cabltetron targets US$200 mln Asia revenue.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cabletron Systems Asia Pacific targets to achieve US$200 million in revenue by year 2000 in Asia, excluding Japan, compared to US$30 million now, managing director Lai Kin Sang said on Friday.</p>
</text>
